{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 10094125157985253728,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "2023 Term Steering Council election",
      "source_hash": 6084269808792756154,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "2023년 임기 운영위원회 선거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217718Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 9734061324396574809,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217721Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This document describes the schedule and other details of the December 2022 election for the Python steering council, as specified in :pep:`13`.",
      "source_hash": 4766578966780083913,
      "context_hash": 12633076590506360741,
      "translation": "이 문서는 :pep:`13`\\ 에 명시된 Python 운영위원회의 2022년 12월 선거 일정과 기타 세부 사항을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217722Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This is the steering council election for the 2023 term (i.e. Python 3.12).",
      "source_hash": 10281167286527115521,
      "context_hash": 4995279752008049442,
      "translation": "이는 2023년 임기(즉, Python 3.12)의 운영위원회 선거입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217722Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Election Administration",
      "source_hash": 16550040090148164253,
      "context_hash": 14336421320649552387,
      "translation": "선거 관리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217722Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The steering council appointed the `Python Software Foundation <https://www.python.org/psf-landing/>`__ Director of Infrastructure, Ee Durbin, to administer the election.",
      "source_hash": 4963720401124199556,
      "context_hash": 16543172086966169680,
      "translation": "운영위원회는 선거를 관리하도록 `Python Software Foundation <https://www.python.org/psf-landing/>`__\\ 의 인프라 디렉터인 Ee Durbin을 임명했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217723Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Schedule",
      "source_hash": 17730507104810335965,
      "context_hash": 11421227792956433109,
      "translation": "일정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217723Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There will be a two-week nomination period, followed by a two-week vote.",
      "source_hash": 1528394639829968729,
      "context_hash": 17600752788892744003,
      "translation": "2주간의 후보 지명 기간에 이어 2주간의 투표가 진행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217723Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The nomination period was: November 14, 2022 through `November 28, 2022 AoE <https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Python+Steering+Council+nominations+close&iso=20221129T00&p1=3399>`_ [#note-aoe]_.",
      "source_hash": 18411633153535325202,
      "context_hash": 4569481865559218501,
      "translation": "후보 지명 기간은 2022년 11월 14일부터 `November 28, 2022 AoE <https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Python+Steering+Council+nominations+close&iso=20221129T00&p1=3399>`_\\ 까지였습니다 [#note-aoe]_.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217724Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The voting period was: December 1, 2022 through `December 14, 2022 AoE <https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Python+Steering+Council+voting+closes&iso=20221215T00&p1=3399>`_ [#note-aoe]_.",
      "source_hash": 640206503865080623,
      "context_hash": 11274367956668912895,
      "translation": "투표 기간은 2022년 12월 1일부터 `December 14, 2022 AoE <https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Python+Steering+Council+voting+closes&iso=20221215T00&p1=3399>`_\\ 까지였습니다 [#note-aoe]_.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217724Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Candidates",
      "source_hash": 1549024387910241940,
      "context_hash": 18391710826692853498,
      "translation": "후보자",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217724Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Candidates must be nominated by a core team member.",
      "source_hash": 15625689760213116169,
      "context_hash": 520011488141833222,
      "translation": "후보자는 핵심 팀 구성원이 지명해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If the candidate is a core team member, they may nominate themselves.",
      "source_hash": 334448297257708624,
      "context_hash": 8233991916457687150,
      "translation": "후보자가 핵심 팀 구성원인 경우에는 스스로를 지명할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
