      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Withdrawn nominations:",
      "source_hash": 788993590756453881,
      "context_hash": 7877749343265502550,
      "translation": "철회된 후보 지명:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217728Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "None",
      "source_hash": 4387124778405518223,
      "context_hash": 17574083411957277762,
      "translation": "없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217728Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Voter Roll",
      "source_hash": 9433122607206423300,
      "context_hash": 15689242719555303773,
      "translation": "유권자 명부",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217729Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "All active Python core team members are eligible to vote.",
      "source_hash": 16621469274156202773,
      "context_hash": 4650596352921137859,
      "translation": "현재 활동 중인 모든 Python 핵심 팀 구성원은 투표할 자격이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217729Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Active status is determined as :pep:`described in PEP 13 <13#membership>` and implemented via the software at `python/voters <https://github.com/python/voters>`_ [#note-voters]_.",
      "source_hash": 14284167419219041845,
      "context_hash": 605445564309789585,
      "translation": "활동 상태는 :pep:`described in PEP 13 <13#membership>`\\ 에 따라 결정되며 `python/voters <https://github.com/python/voters>`_ 소프트웨어를 통해 구현됩니다 [#note-voters]_.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217729Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Ballots will be distributed based on the the `Python Voter Roll <https://github.com/python/voters/blob/master/voter-files/>`_ [#note-voters]_ for this election.",
      "source_hash": 5762482113784753756,
      "context_hash": 1684888647559389403,
      "translation": "이 선거의 투표용지는 `Python Voter Roll <https://github.com/python/voters/blob/master/voter-files/>`_ [#note-voters]_\\ 을 바탕으로 배포됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217729Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "While this file is not public as it contains private email addresses, the `Complete Voter Roll`_ by name will be made available when the roll is created.",
      "source_hash": 8895222127747436580,
      "context_hash": 15040291021671452232,
      "translation": "이 파일에는 개인 이메일 주소가 포함되어 있어 공개되지 않지만, 명부가 작성되면 이름별 `Complete Voter Roll`_\\ 이 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217730Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Election Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14636875904910317783,
      "context_hash": 5871905699775747934,
      "translation": "선거 구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217730Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The election will be conducted using the `Helios Voting Service <https://heliosvoting.org>`__.",
      "source_hash": 12155305633836401860,
      "context_hash": 6703703042501557304,
      "translation": "선거는 `Helios Voting Service <https://heliosvoting.org>`__\\ 를 사용하여 진행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:15.217730Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 2620342211383173951,
      "translation": "구성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668562Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Short name: ``2023-python-steering-council``",
      "source_hash": 17052091954410926577,
      "context_hash": 5487713089290816322,
      "translation": "짧은 이름: ``2023-python-steering-council``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668564Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Name: ``2023 Python Steering Council Election``",
      "source_hash": 10760522773074231586,
      "context_hash": 11995596494918546439,
      "translation": "이름: ``2023 Python Steering Council Election``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-02T02:12:04.839924Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Description: ``Election for the Python steering council, as specified in PEP 13. This is steering council election for the 2023 term.``",
      "source_hash": 373281514679197265,
      "context_hash": 15547648655673488264,
      "translation": "설명: ``PEP 13에 명시된 대로 Python 운영 위원회(steering council)를 선출하는 선거입니다. 이는 2023년 임기를 위한 운영 위원회 선거입니다.``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-02T02:12:04.839924Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "type: ``Election``",
      "source_hash": 3508758751667272147,
      "context_hash": 14837667534975946925,
      "translation": "유형: ``Election``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-02T02:12:04.839924Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Use voter aliases: ``[X]``",
      "source_hash": 6420327067346077552,
      "context_hash": 4324876294268590285,
      "translation": "유권자 별칭 사용: ``[X]``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668565Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Randomize answer order: ``[X]``",
      "source_hash": 5928645120194261760,
      "context_hash": 759582769479510908,
      "translation": "답변 순서 무작위화: ``[X]``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668565Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Private: ``[X]``",
      "source_hash": 6706957759352342153,
      "context_hash": 3192289323522243535,
      "translation": "비공개: ``[X]``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668565Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Help Email Address: ``psf-election@python.org``",
      "source_hash": 3882621641688055594,
      "context_hash": 11383175060903778803,
      "translation": "도움말 이메일 주소: ``psf-election@python.org``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668566Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Voting starts at: ``December 1, 2022 12:00 UTC``",
      "source_hash": 3913633612547491023,
      "context_hash": 1246996807244748859,
      "translation": "투표 시작 시각: ``December 1, 2022 12:00 UTC``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668566Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Voting ends at: ``December 15, 2022 12:00 UTC``",
      "source_hash": 9112534030860623301,
      "context_hash": 10093016361139115599,
      "translation": "투표 종료 시각: ``December 15, 2022 12:00 UTC``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668566Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "This will create an election in which:",
      "source_hash": 5853243356611201665,
      "context_hash": 11338338714690887641,
      "translation": "다음과 같은 선거가 생성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668566Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Voting is not open to the public, only those on the `Voter Roll`_ may participate.",
      "source_hash": 12955082363503104037,
      "context_hash": 9435577545546581284,
      "translation": "투표는 공개되지 않으며, `Voter Roll`_\\ 에 등록된 사람만 참여할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668566Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "Ballots will be emailed when voting starts.",
      "source_hash": 13123851619577654445,
      "context_hash": 3681668820020388086,
      "translation": "투표가 시작되면 투표용지가 이메일로 발송됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668567Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Candidates are presented in random order, to help avoid bias.",
      "source_hash": 14785501000558521769,
      "context_hash": 17155140882741695243,
      "translation": "편향을 방지할 수 있도록 후보자가 무작위 순서로 표시됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:37:15.668567Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Voter identities and ballots are protected against cryptographic advances.",
      "source_hash": 8518556499718116435,
      "context_hash": 4093047784447268713,
      "translation": "유권자의 신원과 투표용지는 암호 기술의 발전으로부터 보호됩니다.",
